{"content":[{"c":["JOBAB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Joktan’s son in Eber’s line (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.10.29","r":"Gen.10.29","rawR":"Gen.10.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.10.29","value":"Gen.10.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 10:29"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.23","r":"1Chr.1.23","rawR":"1Chr.1.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.23","value":"1Chr.1.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Early Edomite king. He was the son of Zerah of Bozrah (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.33-34","r":"Gen.36.33-34","rawR":"Gen.36.33-34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.33-34","value":"Gen.36.33-34"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:33-34"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.44-45","r":"1Chr.1.44-45","rawR":"1Chr.1.44-45","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.44-45","value":"1Chr.1.44-45"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:44-45"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. King of Madon who, along with other Canaanite kings, joined Jabin of Hazor in a northern confederacy to stop the Israelites from taking over the northern section of Canaan. He was killed in battle at the waters of Merom (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.11.1","r":"Josh.11.1","rawR":"Josh.11.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.11.1","value":"Josh.11.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 11:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.12.19","r":"Josh.12.19","rawR":"Josh.12.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.12.19","value":"Josh.12.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Shaharaim’s son by his wife Hodesh, a member of Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.9","r":"1Chr.8.9","rawR":"1Chr.8.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.9","value":"1Chr.8.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Elpaal’s son from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.18","r":"1Chr.8.18","rawR":"1Chr.8.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.18","value":"1Chr.8.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:18"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jobab","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e5